Tienen su propia licencia (Creative Commons Attribution), que es la que se les
aplica, y no esta. Su origen, su licencia y el texto de atribución están en
CREDITOS.md.

ENGLISH

The source code, design, texts and icons of Trasteando are the work of Pablo
Díaz Guerra. They are published in this repository so that they can be read,
but no licence is granted to copy, modify, distribute, publish or use them in
other projects, in whole or in part, without the author's prior written
permission. Because the repository is hosted on GitHub, only the rights that
GitHub's Terms of Service grant to its users (viewing the repository and
forking it within GitHub) are preserved.

Exception: the guitar recordings in the samples/ folder, their excerpts in
tests/muestras-afinador/ and the copies included in dist/ are not the author's
work. They have their own licence (Creative Commons Attribution), which applies
to them instead of this one. Their source, licence and attribution text are in
CREDITOS.md.
